       <widget class="QLabel" name="recovery_phrase_help_label">
        <property name="text">
          <string>Enter 12 or 24 BIP39 English words separated by spaces. Complete chain-derived transaction history and current spendable funds are restored automatically before the wallet opens. Existing chains require the wallet history indexes and unpruned block data.</string>
